.TH AI-STATS 1 "November 2026" "AI-Stats" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ai-stats \- local AI chat statistics and usage reports
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ai-stats
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B ai-stats --fun-stats
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
AI-Stats produces PISG-inspired statistics from local Claude Code and Codex
session logs. It also collects provider usage and cost data in a local SQLite
cache and renders reports in multiple formats.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
Create the private configuration directory and cache.
.TP
.B config show|path|set
Inspect or edit configuration. Prefer environment variables for credentials.
.TP
.B providers list|test
List configured providers or test their connectivity.
.TP
.B sync
Fetch usage and cost data from enabled providers.
.TP
.B import FILE
Import CSV or JSON usage records.
.TP
.B report
Render a usage and cost report.
.TP
.B models
Query model inventories from configured local inference servers.
.SH FUN STATS
.TP
.B --fun-stats
Read local Claude Code and Codex logs and generate a report. As root, scans all
local accounts; otherwise scans only the invoking account.
.TP
.BI --format " FORMAT"
Choose text, markdown, html, json, or discord.
.TP
.BI --period " PERIOD"
Choose a period such as 7d, 30d, month, or all.
.TP
.BI --output " FILE"
Write the report to a file. HTML output is self-contained.
.TP
.BI --ssh-host " HOST"
Explicitly include a remote machine. Requires --ssh-key and remote Python 3.
.TP
.B --send
With Discord output, explicitly deliver the report to the configured webhook.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AI_STATS_CONFIG_DIR
Override the configuration and cache directory.
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Parent configuration directory, used when AI_STATS_CONFIG_DIR is not set.
.TP
.B OPENAI_ADMIN_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_API_KEY
Provider admin credentials. Environment values override configuration values.
.TP
.B AI_STATS_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL
Webhook used only when delivery is explicitly requested.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/ai-stats/config.yaml
Private provider and application configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ai-stats/cache/usage.db
Local usage and cost cache.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
ai-stats init
ai-stats --fun-stats --format html --output stats.html
ai-stats report --period 30d --format markdown
.fi
.SH PRIVACY
Reports should be reviewed before sharing. Pseudonyms hide account names but
activity patterns may still be recognizable. Never publish configuration files,
credentials, private chat logs, or unreviewed usage reports.
.SH SEE ALSO
Run ai-stats --help or ai-stats COMMAND --help for the complete option list.
